296
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:50,240
Sui'er,

297
00:15:50,919 --> 00:15:51,720
what's the matter

298
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:52,799
that you called me here in such a hurry?

299
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:56,679
Prince Yu has just returned to the capital.

300
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,600
I've never met him before.

301
00:15:59,039 --> 00:15:59,799
How can he help me?

302
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:04,679
Sui'er,

303
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,600
I know after the death of our teacher,

304
00:16:06,799 --> 00:16:07,960
the Prime Minister's Residence is not as good as before.

305
00:16:08,759 --> 00:16:09,639
If you need help,

306
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:10,919
I can help you at any time.

307
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:12,840
But my uncle,

308
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,759
you shouldn't be so close to him.

309
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:18,960
Brother Zhao, don't worry.

310
00:16:19,720 --> 00:16:20,480
I promise you,

311
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,039
Prince Yu and I

312
00:16:22,279 --> 00:16:23,639
are not what you think.

313
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:26,399
That's the best.

314
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,200
I'll go back first.

315
00:16:44,519 --> 00:16:45,320
Your Highness,

316
00:16:45,799 --> 00:16:47,440
isn't it cruel to Miss Shen?

317
00:16:48,799 --> 00:16:50,480
I've given her a chance to choose,

318
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:54,159
but she chose

319
00:16:54,159 --> 00:16:55,360
the wrong way.
